# app/ultrat.atm: BOOT held at reset, so it learns the commands (start,
# prepare, stop; a second start is ignored). Then it fights from the
# start to the stop: S3 (pin 35) sees the target for 50ms.
0     hold 0 0
100   ir nec 0x00 0x10
200   ir nec 0x00 0x10
300   ir nec 0x00 0x11
400   ir nec 0x00 0x12
1000  ir nec 0x00 0x10
1500  pin 35 1
1550  pin 35 0
2000  ir nec 0x00 0x12
2100  quit
